TESTING

The Linux Companion is in testing. These releases are test builds: things may change or break between them,
and your reports are what improve it. If something doesn't work, looks wrong or could be better, please tell us:

  Offhand Discord:  https://discord.gg/J2P3SM6pAY
  GitHub Issues:    https://github.com/Abysmal-Kabal/offhand-linux-companion-releases/issues
  Website:          https://www.offhandwow.com/  (setup guides and help)

A report helps most with:
  - your distribution and version, and desktop (GNOME, KDE Plasma, ...)
  - your displays and the layout you use
  - the Companion's version:  offhand-companion --version
  - what you did, what happened and what you expected
  - the output of:  offhand-companion status
